   "title": "Seoul closely watches how Korean Peninsula issues may be handled at US-China-Russia summit",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/foreignaffairs/20261119/seoul-closely-watches-how-korean-peninsula-issues-may-be-handled-at-us-china-russia-summit",
